Netboot (PXE/iPXE) infrastructure for OPNsense.

A single content root served simultaneously by TFTP (read-only, for firmware
PXE/UEFI bootstrap), HTTP (read-only, for iPXE chainloaded payloads and UEFI
HTTP Boot), and optionally SFTP (write, for admin bulk ingress). A web GUI
file manager handles per-file upload, download, delete, and server-side
fetch-from-URL so files can be pulled directly onto the firewall without
shell access. Adds a Dnsmasq "DHCP boot" wiring helper that populates BIOS
and UEFI arch-aware entries automatically, and installs its own firewall
pass rules for the configured listen interfaces.
